      "notes": ["Chain Heal is the raid heal, Healing Wave (with Healing Way stacks) the tank heal, Lesser Healing Wave the emergency heal.", "Alternative 'Enhancing Totems' and 'Improved Weapon Totems' support builds move points into Enhancement for melee groups (see Enhancement build)."],
